# Mid-task attenuation, from inside one running sandbox.
#
# Claim 4: a grant can be narrowed while the task is running, and the narrowing takes
# effect on subsequent syscalls in the same sandbox. All three actions happen in one
# container: the host narrows the scope between the first probe and the second, and
# the marker file is how the two sides agree on the ordering without a sleep race.
#
# Both probes name the same host on purpose. demo.sh splits this transcript at the
# wait-for line, so the before and after halves are asserted against opposite
# expectations.

probe-egress metrics.local:9101 --via-proxy ${LADDER_PROXY}

wait-for /scratch/narrowed --timeout 30

probe-egress metrics.local:9101 --via-proxy ${LADDER_PROXY}
